<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BOLIVA BEAT MEXICO 3-1 IN COPA AMERICA SEMI-FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLIVA BEAT MEXICO 3-1 IN COPA AMERICA SEMI-FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia beat Mexico 3-1</p>
<p>(halftime 2-1) in a Copa America semi-final Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bolivia - Erwin Sanchez (26), Ramiro Castillo (44), Jaime</p>
<p>Moreno (75)</p>
<p>Mexico - Nicolas Ramirez (5)</p>
<p>Attendance: 46,000</p>
<p>Playing June 26: In Santa Cruz, Peru v Brazil</p>
</text>
